ioned focusing on fitness and gaining strength after being at the gym","Evan is currently speaking to Sam about his situation","Evan keeps in shape by going to the gym","Evan showed Sam his gym membership card as a reminder of his commitment to health"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_0","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_0_qa_13","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What career path has Caroline decided to persue?","golden_answer":"counseling or mental health for Transgender people","hypothesis":"Caroline has decided to pursue a career in counseling and mental health. She started looking into these options after receiving helpful support for her own mental health struggles, with the aim of helping others on their journeys. This decision was solidified on June 27, 2023, when she began exploring mental health as a career.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Caroline is planning to check out career options. (event_time: 2023-05-08T13:56:00Z)\n  - Caroline is lately looking into mental health as a career. (event_time: 2023-06-27T10:37:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to try pottery sometime. (event_time: 2023-09-13T00:09:00Z)\n  - Caroline is thinking about different kinds of jobs. (event_time: 2023-05-08T13:56:00Z)\n  - Caroline is looking into jobs related to counseling. (event_time: 2023-07-12T16:33:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to continue her education. (event_time: 2023-05-08T13:56:00Z)\n  - Caroline is working to turn her dream into a reality (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:1