s to pass on the same support she received to anyone who needs it, indicating that her experiences with support systems have shaped her career aspirations in counseling.\n\nTherefore, it is likely that without the support she received growing up, Caroline may not have developed the same drive to pursue counseling as a career. Her experiences with mental health struggles and the support she received have been pivotal in her decision to help others in similar situations.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Caroline received helpful support regarding her mental health struggles. (event_time: 2023-07-12T16:33:00Z)\n  - Caroline is looking into jobs related to counseling. (event_time: 2023-07-12T16:33:00Z)\n  - Caroline is lately looking into mental health as a career. (event_time: 2023-06-27T10:37:00Z)\n  - Caroline is interested in counseling. (event_time: 2023-05-08T13:56:00Z)\n  - Caroline received invaluable help from people she looked up to during her transition. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Melanie is asking what kind of counseling services Caroline wants to pursue. (event_time: 2023-06-27T10:37:00Z)\n  - The encouragement from those close to Caroline made her who she is. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline wants to pass the same support she received to anyone who needs it. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline started caring more about mental health because of her experiences with counseling and support groups. (event_time: 2023-06-27T10:37:00Z)\n  - People Caroli